#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:1
msgid "Backend Extensions"
msgstr "后端扩展"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:3
msgid ""
"A backend extension is a trusted Python module that a deployment loads "
"into the gateway at startup. It can add an adapter kind, decide who may "
"use the Cloud Agent, or report provider quotas. This page is for "
"developers writing one; for configuration-only changes, see [Distribution"
" customization](distribution-customization.md)."
msgstr ""
"后端扩展是一个可信的 Python 模块，由部署在网关启动时加载进去。它可以添加一种 adapter kind、决定谁可以使用云端 "
"Agent，或者上报 provider 的配额。本页面向编写扩展的开发者；如果只需要改配置，见[发行版定制](distribution-"
"customization.md)。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:9
msgid "Loading an extension"
msgstr "加载扩展"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:11
msgid ""
"`BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` is an optional comma-delimited list of trusted, "
"local Python module names. It is empty by default. Each module must "
"expose a synchronous `register()` function that takes no arguments. The "
"gateway imports and registers each module once per process, after loading"
" dotenv and before constructing runtime routes or consuming their "
"registries. An import or registration failure aborts startup; the gateway"
" does not silently use a different adapter."
msgstr ""
"`BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` 是可选的、以逗号分隔的受信任本地 Python 模块名列表，默认值为空。每个模块必须提供同步、无参数的 "
"`register()` 函数。网关加载 dotenv "
"后、构造运行时路由或使用相关注册表前，在每个进程中导入并注册每个模块一次。导入或注册失败会中止启动；网关不会悄悄换用其他 adapter。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:18
msgid ""
"Extensions register factories through "
"`serving.servers.registry.register_adapter_factory(kind, factory, *, "
"override=False)`. A factory receives a configuration dictionary and "
"returns an adapter, before built-in provider defaults are applied. "
"Registering an existing extension kind is an error. Replacing a built-in "
"kind requires `override=True` and emits a log entry. Registered kinds "
"also become reserved provider labels. The startup `register()` function "
"may populate the existing runtime-setting and provider metadata "
"dictionaries before their consumers run; it must mutate those shared "
"dictionaries rather than replace them."
msgstr ""
"扩展通过 `serving.servers.registry.register_adapter_factory(kind, factory, *,"
" override=False)` 注册工厂。工厂在内置 provider 默认值应用前接收配置字典并返回 adapter。注册已存在的扩展 "
"kind 会报错。替换内置 kind 必须设置 `override=True`，且会记录日志。注册的 kind 也会成为保留的 provider "
"标签。启动时的 `register()` 函数可在使用方运行前，填充现有的运行时设置和 provider "
"元数据字典；必须修改这些共享字典，而不能替换它们。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:28
msgid ""
"The deployment must make these modules importable, for example through "
"its read-only overlay mount. This executes trusted server code, not user-"
"supplied configuration: do not derive module names from requests or allow"
" an admin form to choose them. The loader does not fetch remote modules "
"or load code per request. Import all extension code during startup, avoid"
" later lazy imports or live code reloads, and restart the backend when "
"changing the mounted extension. See [Deployment-local adapters](provider-"
"adapters.md#deployment-local-adapters) for a minimal factory example."
msgstr ""
"部署方必须让这些模块可以被导入，例如通过只读挂载的 "
"overlay。这里执行的是可信的服务端代码，而不是用户提供的配置：不要根据请求推导模块名，也不要让管理表单来选择模块。加载器不会拉取远程模块，也不会按请求加载代码。所有扩展代码都要在启动时导入，之后不要再做延迟导入或代码热重载；修改挂载的扩展后要重启后端。最小的工厂示例见[部署本地"
" adapter](provider-adapters.md#deployment-local-adapters)。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:37
msgid "Cloud Agent access"
msgstr "云端 Agent 访问权限"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:39
msgid ""
"The gateway keeps its fixed role hierarchy and resolves current account "
"state. The deployment owns the rule for who can use or administer its "
"Cloud Agent. A trusted extension registers one synchronous callback "
"during `register()` with "
"`serving.agent_access.register_agent_access_policy(policy)`. The callback"
" receives a read-only mapping containing exactly `user_id` and `role`, "
"after the gateway has verified that the user exists and has status "
"`active`. It receives no profile, credentials, or database connection."
msgstr ""
"网关保留固定的角色层级，并解析账户当前状态。由部署定义谁可以使用或管理其云端 Agent。受信任的扩展在 `register()` 中通过 "
"`serving.agent_access.register_agent_access_policy(policy)` "
"注册一个同步回调。网关先确认用户存在且状态为 `active`，再向回调传入仅包含 `user_id` 和 `role` "
"的只读映射。回调不会收到用户资料、凭据或数据库连接。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:47
msgid ""
"The callback returns a `list[str]` or `tuple[str, ...]` of explicit "
"permissions: `agent.use` permits Agent use, and `agent.admin` permits "
"Agent administration. Administration requires both permissions. Unknown, "
"repeated, or non-string permissions are invalid; values are not coerced. "
"Registering a second policy is an error. With no registered policy, Agent"
" access is denied for every role. The gateway imposes no deployment-"
"specific role-to-permission rule."
msgstr ""
"回调以 `list[str]` 或 `tuple[str, ...]` 返回显式权限：`agent.use` 允许使用 "
"Agent，`agent.admin` 允许管理 "
"Agent。管理操作需要同时具备这两项权限。未知、重复或非字符串权限均无效，框架不会强制转换取值。注册第二个策略会报错。没有注册策略时，所有角色都无权访问"
" Agent。网关不规定特定部署的角色与权限映射规则。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:54
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The standalone Agent reads `GET /internal/users/{user_id}/agent-access` "
"using the existing `GATEWAY_GRANT_DISPATCH_TOKEN` bearer token. A "
"successful response contains exactly `user_id`, `allowed`, and "
"`permissions`; `allowed` is true exactly when `agent.use` is present. "
"Permissions are returned in the order `agent.use`, `agent.admin`. An "
"intentional denial is HTTP 200 with `allowed: false` and `permissions: "
"[]`. The endpoint reads the gateway's operational store and evaluates the"
" policy on each request; it does not cache permission decisions. Account "
"details can be up to 60 seconds old: a change made through this gateway "
"process is seen at once, but one made directly in the database or by "
"another process is seen when the cached account expires."
msgstr ""
"独立部署的 Agent 使用现有的 `GATEWAY_GRANT_DISPATCH_TOKEN` bearer token 读取 `GET "
"/internal/users/{user_id}/agent-access`。成功的响应只包含 `user_id`、`allowed` 和 "
"`permissions` 三个字段；当且仅当权限中包含 `agent.use` 时，`allowed` 才为 true。权限按 "
"`agent.use`、`agent.admin` 的顺序返回。有意拒绝时返回 HTTP 200，内容为 `allowed: false` 和 "
"`permissions: []`。该端点每次请求都会读取网关的运行数据存储并重新执行策略，不缓存权限判定结果。账号信息最多可能滞后 60 "
"秒：通过本网关进程所做的修改立即可见，而直接改数据库或由其他进程所做的修改，要等缓存的账号信息过期后才能看到。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:65
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Unknown or inactive accounts receive HTTP 403 with error type "
"`subject_unavailable`, before the callback runs. A callback exception or "
"invalid result receives HTTP 503 with error type "
"`agent_access_unavailable`, without policy details. Both use the "
"gateway's standard `{\"error\": {\"type\": ..., \"message\": ...}}` "
"envelope. A request without a valid dispatch token gets 401, and a "
"gateway with the internal API turned off answers 404."
msgstr ""
"不存在或未激活的账号会在回调运行之前收到 HTTP 403，错误类型为 "
"`subject_unavailable`。回调抛出异常或返回无效结果时，返回 HTTP 503，错误类型为 "
"`agent_access_unavailable`，不附带策略细节。两者都使用网关标准的 `{\"error\": {\"type\": "
"..., \"message\": ...}}` 错误格式。没有有效 dispatch token 的请求会得到 401；关闭了内部 API "
"的网关返回 404。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:72
msgid "Quota reporting"
msgstr "配额报告"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:74
msgid ""
"The admin console's **Providers → Quotas** tab and RouteWise's quota-"
"aware routing both read usage from quota sources. The gateway ships with "
"none: a backend extension registers one per provider, reading the "
"provider's usage API or your own metering service. Nothing requires a "
"particular supplier, website login or cookie."
msgstr ""
"管理控制台的 **Providers → Quotas** 标签页和 RouteWise "
"的配额感知路由，都从配额来源读取用量。网关本身不带任何配额来源：由后端扩展为每个 provider 注册一个，读取该 provider 的用量 "
"API 或你自己的计量服务。没有任何环节要求特定的供应商、网站登录或 cookie。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:80
msgid ""
"An extension's `register()` calls "
"`serving.admin.provider_quotas.register_quota_fetcher(provider, "
"display_name, fetch)`; `fetch` is awaited as `fetch(operational_store, "
"services)` and returns one `ProviderQuotaResult` per configured key, "
"converting its own failures into results rather than raising. The admin "
"endpoint supplies the store and services; RouteWise currently calls it "
"with `(None, None)`, so the fetcher must also work without those objects."
" Registration runs at startup, not when the module is merely imported. A "
"fetcher queries usage; it does not send user inference requests or change"
" the route's inference protocol."
msgstr ""
"扩展的 `register()` 调用 "
"`serving.admin.provider_quotas.register_quota_fetcher(provider, "
"display_name, fetch)`；框架通过 `fetch(operational_store, services)` 等待 "
"`fetch` 完成，每个已配置密钥返回一个 "
"`ProviderQuotaResult`，并将失败转换成结果而不是抛出异常。管理端点会提供存储和服务对象；RouteWise 目前传入 "
"`(None, "
"None)`，因此抓取器也必须能在没有这些对象的情况下工作。注册发生在启动阶段，而不是仅导入模块时。抓取器查询用量，不负责发送用户推理请求，也不改变路由的推理协议。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:90
msgid ""
"Each result contains `ProviderQuotaUsage` rows with `label`, `used`, "
"`limit`, `unit` and an optional timezone-aware `reset_at`. The "
"deployment's provider identifier links the source to its routes; it is "
"not a hard-coded vendor enum. `quota_source.provider`, `usage_label` and "
"`unit` must exactly match a returned result and usage row. Report the "
"account/window shared by that quota pool, and keep independent accounts "
"in distinct sources. Do not sum unrelated keys or present a failed query "
"as zero usage."
msgstr ""
"每个结果包含若干 `ProviderQuotaUsage` 行，字段包括 `label`、`used`、`limit`、`unit` "
"和可选的带时区 `reset_at`。部署定义的 provider "
"标识将来源关联到路由，并不是写死的厂商枚举。`quota_source.provider`、`usage_label` 和 `unit` "
"必须与返回的结果及用量行精确匹配。报告该配额池共享账户及窗口的用量，独立账户应使用不同的来源。不要把不相关密钥的用量相加，也不要把查询失败表示成零用量。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:98
msgid ""
"The UI can display percentages, currencies and other units, but "
"RouteWise's quota admission consumes one **request** at a time and "
"requires a compatible count-based source. A percentage alone is not a "
"request allowance. The source owns window boundaries and reset times; "
"`quota.limit` is a cross-check against its reported limit, not a "
"replacement measurement. A source with no successful snapshot stays "
"unready. A failed refresh does not manufacture a fresh balance; an "
"existing pool retains its last successful snapshot and local increments."
msgstr ""
"UI 可以显示百分比、货币和其他单位，但 RouteWise "
"的配额准入每次消耗一次**请求**，要求兼容的计数型来源。只有百分比不足以表示可用请求数。来源负责窗口边界和重置时间；`quota.limit` "
"用于核对来源报告的上限，不能替代实际测量。没有成功快照的来源保持未就绪状态。刷新失败不会凭空产生新的余额；已有的池保留上一次成功快照及本地增量。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:106
msgid "Run a local quota source"
msgstr "运行本地配额来源"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:108
msgid ""
"The complete [example "
"extension](../../distributions/example/quota_extension.py) reads `/usage`"
" from the bundled fake provider. Its in-memory daily counter is for "
"demonstration only: it resets on process restart or at UTC midnight, and "
"is not production accounting. It uses no real account or credential and "
"is loaded only when explicitly selected through `BACKEND_EXTENSIONS`."
msgstr ""
"完整的[示例扩展](../../distributions/example/quota_extension.py)从仓库自带的假 provider"
" 读取 `/usage`。它在内存里维护的每日计数器仅用于演示：进程重启或到 UTC "
"零点时就会清零，不能用作生产环境的计量核算。它不使用任何真实账号或凭据，只有通过 `BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` 显式选中时才会加载。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:114
msgid ""
"After the developer setup, run these commands from the repository root in"
" three terminals. First, start a simulated quota provider:"
msgstr "完成开发环境设置后，在三个终端中从仓库根目录执行这些命令。首先启动模拟的配额 provider："

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:122
msgid ""
"Then start a slower, priced fallback (its prices in the example are "
"fictional):"
msgstr "然后启动较慢的按量计价回退路由（示例中的价格是假设值）："

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:129
msgid ""
"Finally start the gateway with the opt-in [quota "
"registry](../../config/examples/models.routewise.quota.yaml). Name the "
"demo token once so the admin call below can reuse it:"
msgstr ""
"最后使用需要显式选择的[配额注册表](../../config/examples/models.routewise.quota.yaml)启动网关。先把演示用的"
" token 命名一次，下面调用管理接口时复用它："

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:147
msgid ""
"These settings disable dotenv loading and user authentication and use a "
"public demo-only admin token and JWT signing secret: keep the listener on"
" loopback and never use them for a real deployment. The admin endpoint "
"needs the signing secret even when authenticating with the demo token. "
"Read the same result the console uses:"
msgstr ""
"这些设置关闭 dotenv 加载和用户认证，并使用公开的演示专用管理令牌和 JWT "
"签名密钥：监听地址必须保持为回环地址，绝不能用于真实部署。即使使用演示令牌认证，管理端点也需要签名密钥。读取与控制台相同的结果："

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:158
msgid ""
"Send several requests to calibrate the cost envelope and allow the first "
"five-second probe/snapshot cycle to finish:"
msgstr "发送几次请求以校准成本包络，并等待首个五秒探测及快照刷新周期完成："

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:167
msgid ""
"The response identifies the selected fixture. Initial requests use the "
"fallback until the quota route has both a usage snapshot and cost-"
"envelope evidence. Accepted chat requests, including active probes, "
"consume the mock quota; health, model discovery and `/usage` reads do "
"not. To simulate exhaustion, restart only the quota fixture with "
"`--quota-limit 100 --quota-used 100`; after the next snapshot refresh, "
"requests continue through the fallback. Stop each local process with "
"Ctrl+C when finished."
msgstr ""
"响应会标识选中的模拟服务。初始请求走回退路由，直到配额路由同时具备用量快照和成本包络依据。已接受的聊天请求（包括主动探测）会消耗模拟配额；健康检查、模型发现和"
" `/usage` 查询不会。要模拟额度耗尽，只需使用 `--quota-limit 100 --quota-used 100` "
"重启配额模拟服务；下一次快照刷新后，请求继续由回退路由服务。完成后使用 Ctrl+C 停止各个本地进程。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:175
msgid ""
"To see the card in the authenticated Web/Admin Console, configure this "
"same extension and registry on a local full-stack demo backend, then open"
" **Providers → Quotas**. Use a quota endpoint reachable from that "
"backend: inside Compose, `127.0.0.1` denotes the backend container, not "
"the host. The [Quickstart](router-tutorial.md) covers the full-stack demo"
" and its authentication. With no returned results the Quotas tab stays "
"visible and links back here; the Overview, Keys, Availability and "
"Performance tabs work without any quota source."
msgstr ""
"要在登录后的 Web 控制台／管理控制台里看到这张卡片，请在本地的全栈演示后端上配置同一个扩展和模型注册表，然后打开 **Providers → "
"Quotas**。配额端点必须能从该后端访问到：在 Compose 里，`127.0.0.1` "
"指的是后端容器，而不是宿主机。全栈演示及其认证见[快速开始](router-tutorial.md)。没有返回任何结果时，Quotas "
"标签页仍然可见，并链接回本页；Overview、Keys、Availability 和 Performance "
"这几个标签页不需要任何配额来源也能正常使用。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:184
msgid ""
"For your own integration, copy the extension and replace its local HTTP "
"query and mapping with your authorized data source. Preserve the result "
"contract, bound network requests with a timeout, handle failures "
"explicitly and keep credentials out of responses and logs. The provider's"
" own terms still govern how you may query its usage."
msgstr ""
"对接你自己的数据源时，复制这个扩展，把其中的本地 HTTP "
"查询和字段映射换成你获得授权的数据源。保持结果契约不变，给网络请求加上超时，显式处理失败，并确保凭据不出现在响应和日志中。至于能以什么方式查询 "
"provider 的用量，仍以该 provider 自己的条款为准。"
